R Data Frame Practice — Level 1 → Level 4
Dataset

Run this first:

students <- data.frame(
  ID = c(101, 102, 103, 104, 105, 106, 107, 108),
  Name = c("Amit", "Priya", "Rahul", "Sneha", "Vikram", "Neha", "Arjun", "Kiran"),
  Age = c(21, 22, 20, 23, 21, 24, 22, 19),
  Score = c(78, 92, 65, 88, 55, 95, 72, 61),
  Department = c("SAS", "R", "SAS", "R", "Python", "SAS", "Python", "R")
)
